Package: novaRush
Type: Package
Title: R Client for the Fluree v4 Graph Database
Version: 0.3.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Christiaan", "Pauw",
           email = "christiaan.pauw@nova.org.za",
           role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Nova Institute NPC", role = "cph"))
Description: Read from and write to a Fluree v4 ledger. Queries are composed with
    pipeable verbs and return tibbles; JSON-LD Query, SPARQL and history queries
    are all supported, as are signed messages, time travel and RDFS/OWL reasoning.
    Data goes in as a triple table, a 'tidygraph' graph or raw JSON-LD, and query
    results come back as a tibble or a graph. Ledger administration covers
    branches, named graphs, and storage and exact similarity search over native
    Fluree vectors. The lower-level R6 interface ('FlureeInstance' and friends)
    remains available for full control of the request cycle.
